  "notes": [
   "Elective courses are printed by category (Fire Fighter Academy, Structure Fire Fighter Classes, Rescue, Engine Operation, Wildland Fire Suppression, Wildland Fire Behavior, Company Officer, Incident Command, Fire Investigation/Prevention, Fire Instructor, Leadership, Prescribed Fire, Planning and Logistics, Emergency Medical Services) with no units beside them; units recorded as null. Abbreviated numbers (e.g. 'FIRS 108, 137, ...') were expanded with their subject.",
